The management panel also embeds CottenDNS (MIT), maintained by tajirax,
through the WhiteDNS/CottenDns integration fork. CottenDNS derives from
StormDNS (NullRoute1970) and MasterDnsVPN (Amin Mahmoudi). Their original
notices are retained in licenses/CottenDNS-LICENSE.txt. The pinned revision
and dependency versions are recorded in SOURCE-VERSIONS.txt.
